    "text": "thegazebogazette.com\nwebsite\nPass Christian\nPirates Burn Wildcats for Third Consecutive Victory\nBy Hunter Dawkins,\n14 hours agoLEAKESVILLE (GG) — As the saying goes, “Revenge is a dish best served cold.” Indeed it was Friday night, October 3 with the Pass Christian Pirates (5-1, 1-0) football team shutting out the lights for the Greene County Wildcats (4-2, 0-1) 28-14 in the first Region 8-4A matchup. Not only was this the third consecutive victory for the Pirates, this counts as revenge for the 33-25 win the Wildcats walked away with the last time they faced one another back in October of 2024.",
